<!--
    Vector icons (24×24 unless noted). They replace the Segoe Fluent Icons glyphs of the WPF version, which do not
    exist on Linux and macOS. Shown with PathIcon, which fills them with the control's Foreground.
    Default fill rule is EvenOdd, which cuts the inner rings out of the outlined icons.
-->
